{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_d593555641ca46c0ba21493c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a good understanding of the codebase. Let me plan the performance optimization changes for Unit 8. I need to be strategic about what to include - focusing on the highest-impact, safest changes.\n\nLet me create a focused plan:\n\n**Frontend optimizations:**\n1. React.memo on AnnotationLayer (high impact - N pages × annotation changes)\n2. React.memo on LogLine (high impact - up to 500 items)\n3. React.memo on tab components (OverviewTab, MethodTab, ExperimentsTab, OutlineTab, InterviewTab)\n4. Lazy-load mermaid in FlowChart\n\n\n5. Lazy-load recharts in ExperimentsTab\n6. Fix useUIConfig referential stability\n7. Move setHelpCallback to useEffect in Layout\n\n**Backend optimizations:**\n1. Single shared database engine\n2. N+1 query fix in workspaces\n3. N+1 query fix in tags\n4. Config file caching in ai_config\n\nFor a single round, I should be focused. Let me pick the most impactful and safest items. I'll prioritize React.memo on AnnotationLayer and LogLine since those have the clearest performance wins, then tackle the lazy-loading for mermaid and recharts to reduce bundle size, and finally address the useUIConfig stability issue to prevent unnecessary re-renders across the app.\n\nOn the backend side, consolidating the database engine and fixing the N+1 queries in workspaces and tags will have the most impact. Let me start implementing these changes.","signature":""}],"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"29257b8f-ede7-46a4-8e0f-a743591d296a","uuid":"91dd051f-242e-4804-8304-a6721698ee28"}
