",\"session_id\":\"29257b8f-ede7-46a4-8e0f-a743591d296a\"}\n{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":175,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":1,\"uuid\":\"e2fe83a8-24d7-45cd-b621-4e9508a831a1\",\"session_id\":\"29257b8f-ede7-46a4-8e0f-a743591d296a\"}\n{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":179,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":4,\"uuid\":\"3c0d996c-0f13-4330-b527-4803d10a0e77\",\"session_id\":\"29257b8f-ede7-46a4-8e0f-a743591d296a\"}\n{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":183,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":4,\"uuid\":\"bb798f51-efd6-41d6-8052-ae08e97981c5\",\"session_id\":\"29257b8f-ede7-46a4-8e0f-a743591d296a\"}\n{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":184,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":1,\"uuid\":\"1f4bf2e8-c57a-4e34-9420-eb9ae855fe3b\",\"session_id\":\"29257b8f-ede7-46a4-8e0f-a743591d296a\"}\n{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_e9891e35c3014d55947d442a\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"mimo-v2.5-pro\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"Now I have a comprehensive understanding. Let me write the plan for Unit 8 (Performance Optimization). I'll focus on the most impactful and safest changes:\\n\\n**Frontend:**\\n1. React.memo on AnnotationLayer, LogLine, FlowChart, ExperimentsTab\\n2. Lazy-load mermaid in FlowChart (dynamic import)\\n3. Fix useUIConfig referential stability (shallow comparison)\\n4. Move setHelpCallback to useEffect in Layout\\n\\n**Backend:**\\n1. Single shared engine in database.py + import everywhere\\n2. N+1 query fix in workspaces (LEFT JOIN + GROUP BY)\\n\\n\\n3. N+1 query fix in tags (LEFT JOIN + GROUP BY)\\n4. Config caching in ai_config.py (mtime check)\\n\\nNow let me write out the plan file.\",\"signature\":\"\"}],\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0},\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"29257b8f-ede7-46a4-8e0f-a743591d296a\",\"uuid\":\"0ba38fef-fefd-42b3-869d-06d90ee02c07\"}\n{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_e9891e35c3014d55947d442a\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"mimo-v2.5-pro\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"call_726b7fe2d54646b9b89150d1\",\"name\":\"Write\",\"input\":{\"file_path\":\"/Users/katisarrow/.claude/plans/mellow-riding-mccarthy.md\",\"content\":\"# Unit 8: 性能优化实施计划\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n7/8 单元已完成合并，Unit 8 是最后一个单元——性能优化。前端探索发现零处 React.memo 使用、mermaid/recharts 未懒加载、useUIConfig 每次返回新引用导致全树重渲染。后端发现 8+ 个重复引擎实例、N+1 查询模式、配置文件每次请求都从磁盘读取。\\n\\n## 改动清单（按影响排序，共 8 项）\\n\\n### 前端（5 项）\\n\\n**1. React.memo — AnnotationLayer + LogLine + FlowChart + tab 组件**\\n- `frontend/src/features/viewer/AnnotationLayer.tsx`: 用 `React.memo` 包裹导出，避免 N 个 PDF 页面中任何一个标注变化时全部页面重渲染\\n- `frontend/src/components/TerminalPanel.tsx`: `LogLine` 包裹 `React.memo`，日志列表最多 500 条，新增一条不应重渲染所有已有行\\n- `frontend/src/features/analysis/FlowChart.tsx`: 包裹 `React.memo`，mermaid 渲染是 CPU 密集操作\\n- `frontend/src/features/analysis/tabs/ExperimentsTab.tsx`: 包裹 `React.memo`\\n\\n**2. Lazy-load mermaid（动态 import）**\\n- `FlowChart.tsx`: 将 `import mermaid from 'mermaid'` 改为组件内 `const mermaid = await import('mermaid')`，mermaid ~500KB，只有 Method tab 才需要\\n- 用 `useMemo` + `useState` 懒加载 mermaid 实例\\n\\n**3. useUIConfig 引用稳定性**\\n- `frontend/src/hooks/useConfig.ts` L85-105: `setUI({ ...saved, ...previewOverrides })` 每次创建新对象引用，即使配置未变化\\n- 修复：在 `setUI` 前做浅比较（JSON.stringify 或逐字段比较），仅在值变化时才更新\\n\\n**4. Layout render-time side effect → useEffect**\\n- `frontend/src/components/Layout.tsx` L52-53: `setHelpCallback(toggleShortcuts)` 在渲染体内调用\\n- 移到 `useEffect(() => { setHelpCallback(toggleShortcuts) }, [toggleShortcuts])` 中\\n\\n**5. ExperimentsTab useThemeColors 稳定性**\\n- 当前 `useUIConfig()` 每次返回新引用 → `useMemo` 依赖 `[ui.theme]` 虽然只在主题变化时重算，但 `ui` 引用变化导致 effect 重跑\\n- 配合第 3 项修复后自然解决\\n\\n### 后端（3 项）\\n\\n**6. 统一数据库引擎实例**\\n- `backend/services/database.py`: 导出共享 `_engine` 单例 + `get_engine()` 函数\\n- 以下文件删除各自的 `_get_engine()` 改为 `from ..services.database import get_engine`:\\n  - `backend/routers/papers.py`\\n  - `backend/routers/analysis.py`\\n  - `backend/routers/code.py`\\n  - `backend/routers/workspaces.py`\\n  - `backend/routers/research.py`\\n  - `backend/routers/tags.py`\\n  - `backend/routers/notes.py`\\n  - `backend/routers/annotations.py`\\n  - `backend/services/analysis_runner.py`\\n  - `backend/services/auto_indexer.py`\\n\\n**7. N+1 查询修复 — 工作区和标签列表**\\n- `backend/routers/workspaces.py` L60-74: 用 `func.count()` 子查询替代循环\\n- `backend/routers/tags.py` L42-55: 同理\\n\\n**8. ai_config 配置缓存**\\n- `backend/services/ai_config.py` L121-135: 加 mtime 缓存，避免每次请求都读磁盘\\n- 缓存结构: `_cache: dict | None = None`, `_mtime: float = 0`\\n- `load_config()` 先 `os.path.getmtime()` 与 `_mtime` 比较，未变化直接返回缓存\\n\\n## 不改的部分（及原因）\\n\\n- **PDF 虚拟化**: 改动太大，需要重写 PdfViewer，风险高，不适合单轮\\n- **useStreaming 合并为 useReducer**: 需要改动 SSE 消费逻辑和多个下游组件，风险较高\\n- **aiosqlite**: 迁移成本高，当前单用户场景影响有限\\n\\n## 验证方式\\n\\n1. `cd frontend && npx tsc --noEmit` — 类型检查零错误\\n2. `cd frontend && npm run build` — Vite 构建成功\\n3. `cd backend && python -c \\\"from backend.services.database import get_engine\\\"` — 引擎导入正常\\n4. 手动检查: 每个修改的文件 diff 确认无回归\\n\\n## 版本更新\\n\\n- `frontend/package.json`: 1.12.4 → 1.12.5\\n- `frontend/src/components/VersionPopup.tsx`: APP_VERSION = '1.12.5'，CURRENT_RELEASE 更新日志\\n\"}}],\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0},\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"29257b8f-ede7-46a4-8e0f-a743591d296a\",\"uuid\":\"cd839437-4d3a-4824-ab59-18afbd38e77b\"}\n{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"call_726b7fe2d54646b9b89150d1\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"File created successfully at: /Users/katisarrow/.claude/plans/mellow-riding-mccarthy.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"29257b8f-ede7-46a4-8e0f-a743591d296a\",\"uuid\":\"a38